# Comp-Dash UI & Theme Rules

1. **Dark/Light Mode Standard:**
   - Primary dark card background: `bg-white dark:bg-[#18181b]`
   - Input background: `bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900`
   - Primary text: `text-gray-900 dark:text-white`
   - Secondary text: `text-gray-500 dark:text-zinc-400`
   - Borders: `border-gray-200 dark:border-zinc-800`

2. **Hover & Micro-interactions:**
   - NEVER use `hover:bg-gray-50/50` or `dark:hover:bg-obsidian-hover` on table `<tr>` rows (prevents background flashing).
   - Add subtle text scale on student/advisor name wrappers: `transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-[1.02] origin-left`.
   - Add hover scaling on primary buttons & tags: `transition-transform duration-200 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95`.

3. **Forbidden Tokens:**
   - Do NOT use custom `obsidian-*` or `ink-*` classes. Replace them with standard Tailwind `zinc-*` scale.